Description: fast, modern terminal emulator with tabs, splits and profiles
 Zephyr Terminal is a native Linux terminal emulator written in C++20 and
 Qt 6. It offers tabs, nested split panes, scrollback search, shell and SSH
 profiles, themes with transparency, a command palette, editable keybindings
 and session restore.
 .
 The package also ships the "zephyr" command-line toolkit and the
 "zephyr-shell" interactive shell.
